(4x/day).  These are the 0.9950 sigma level values.</dd><dt><span>platform :</span></dt><dd>Model</dd><dt><span>references :</span></dt><dd>http://www.esrl.noaa.gov/psd/data/gridded/data.ncep.reanalysis.html</dd><dt><span>title :</span></dt><dd>4x daily NMC reanalysis (1948)</dd></dl></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div>
